    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 22.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf ðegen hæbbe getreowe man to foraðe for hine þæt swa sy; gyf he næbbe, ofga sylf his spæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a thegn has a trustworthy man to give his oath of accusation for him, he may be allowed to make use of him; if he has not, he must begin his case in person.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf þegen hæbbe getrywne man to foraðe for hine, þæt swa sig; gyf he næbbe, ofga sylf his spæce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
